description:
This is Wavetech, a global community centered around the WaveTech SMP. A technical minecraft server that launched in June 2020 and has over 50 dedicated members who work together to push the game to its limits. In this video we celebrate Wavetechs 5 year anniversary with a look at some of its grandest accomplishments through beautifully rendered cinema.

Wavetech Server Discord:
https://discord.gg/SR6q7sC

If you would like to learn more about specific projects shown in this video be sure to check out the YouTube channels of other Wavetech Members like:
@JKM115 
@xoid3
@la1m1e
@Ruthro
@kades2357 
@mrmaxmondays

The clips in this video were made through a combination of mods such as Distant Horizons, Flashback and Iris Shaders. The shaders used were a combination of BSL, Kappa, Bliss and Rethinking Voxels.

The music is my own composition titled The Retro Fad, the full version of this song can be found on my second channel:
https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCU__v62MRRYVO8IRDKh0adQ
